  paragraphs:
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: How are you feeling?
  - speakerName: ???
    text: "I'm fine, don\u2019t worry."
  - speakerName: ???
    text: I should be the one taking care of you, like a good big sister.
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: "Don\u2019t be ridiculous, you need rest. I\u2019ll focus on finding a
      solution, I've got this."
  - speakerName: ???
    text: "It\u2019s just... I wish I could spend more time with you, since I don\u2019t
      know how much longer I can hold on."
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: ...
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: "Once you\u2019re better, we\u2019ll do anything you want. I promise I\u2019ll
      find a way to break the curse, no matter what it takes."
  - speakerName: ???
    text: ...
  - speakerName: Momo
    text: Please... be careful.
